\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces LLM-based automated preprocessing pipeline (Section 4.6). After file upload and profiling (Section 4.2), the Qwen2.5:14B model retrieves clinical context from ChromaDB (RAG), analyzes each row, and proposes justified corrections. After clinician review and Chef de service approval, the cleaned data enters the ML pipeline.}}{55}{figure.caption.44}%
